    <mediaPropertyAltText>
      <Value><![CDATA[The dark stone gabled facade of Renishaw Hall seen from the formal Italianate gardens, with clipped yew topiary and a long stone-edged pond leading away from the house.]]></Value>
    </mediaPropertyAltText>
    <mediaPropertyCountry>
