  "United Kingdom"
]]]></Value>
    </mediaPropertyCountry>
    <mediaPropertyDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[Family home of the Sitwells for almost four centuries, set in eight acres of Italianate gardens designed by Sir George Sitwell, with terraces, statues, ornamental ponds and one of the finest collections of family portraits, ceramics and modern art in the country.]]></Value>
